[9.378, "\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m  3 \u001b[22mImplementation: `run.py` (Python 3.12 standard library only: `sys`, `math`, `struct`, `array`).\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  4 \u001b[22mStart: `python3 run.py <checkpoint.bin> <tokenizer.bin>`, then the INTERFACE.md line protocol.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m  5 \u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m  6 \u001b[22m## Commands run\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m  7 \u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m  8 \u001b[22m```\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m  9 \u001b[22mpython3 --version                      # Python 3.12.13 (/Users/Shared/pvc-kit/stdlib/bin/python3)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22mpython3 -c '...struct.unpack(\"7i\")...' # read model header: dim 768, hidden 2048, 12 layers,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u2026\u001b[8G+57 \u001b[13Gines \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;44;122;57m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBackground command \"Run the suppli\u001b[38Gd validati\u001b[49Gn \u001b[52Gests\" completed (exit code 0)\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe\u001b[7Gchecker\u001b[15G"]
[9.379, "appends\u001b[23Gthe\u001b[27Gmodel\u001b[33Gand\u001b[37Gtokenizer\u001b[47Gpaths\u001b[53Gitself,\u001b[61Gso\u001b[64GI'll\u001b[69Gpass\u001b[74Gonly\u001b[79Gthe\u001b[83Gprogram:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m The checker is running now with the right invocation, \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mpython3 check.py -- python3 -I run.py\u001b[39m. At about 2.6 s per token\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  it will take a few minutes. I'll report the result and add it to NOTES.md when it finishes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u273b\u001b[3GBrewed for 3m 20s \u00b7 done 2:37 PM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBackground shell command didn't finish before the previous\u001b[62Gsession\u001b[70Gended\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u276f \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mProfile this implementation on the supplied development workloads. Improve performance within the same rules and \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mremaining budget. Preserve the interface and correctness requirements. Do not use hidden evaluation inputs, external \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2"]
[9.38, ";0;0;0mimplementations or other ports. Record profiling evidence, changes, tests and remaining limitations in NOTES.md.\u001b[39m      \r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u23fa\u001b[39m Checking partial checker output and look for workloads\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m  \u23bf  $ cat /private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-agentlab-pvc-p1/7508332c-ec7a-43fb-9494-beed4228115c/tasks/bnt3z6q70.output; \r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[4G  \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mls -la /Users/agentlab/pvc/p1 /Users/agentlab/pvc 2>&1\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m\u273d\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;234;138;106mPontificating\u2026\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;102;102;102m(4s \u00b7 \u2193\u001b[26G370 tokens)\r\u001b[1B  \u23bf \u00a0Tip: Use Plan Mode to prepare for a complex request before making changes. Press shift+tab twice to enable.\r\u001b[3C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m       \u001b[12G     \u001b[18G       \u001b[26G    \u001b[31G                   \u001b[51G    \u001b[56G    \u001b[61G       \u001b[103G\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u25cf high \u00b7 /effort\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;138;138;138m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
